<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN BBL CUTS INVESTMENT LOAN RATES.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN BBL CUTS INVESTMENT LOAN RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank Banque Bruxelles</p>
<p>Lambert SA said on Tuesday it would lower the interest rates it</p>
<p>charges on company investment loans with effect from Thursday.</p>
<p>The new (old) rates are (in percent):</p>
<p> * Three-year revisable rate loans	 6.00 (6.30)</p>
<p> * Five-year revisable rate loans	  6.95 (7.20)</p>
<p> * Ten-year fixed rate loans		 8.05 (8.25)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
